function _psReady(q){/* v99-m 任务11：_ps 空引用族的统一守卫。q 为真时静默返回（画函数），否则给用户一句提示（交互 handler） */
  if(_ps)return true;
  if(!q){try{toast('资料面板还没载入，请从 设置 → Space 进入')}catch(e){}}
  return false;
}
function drawSwatches(){
  if(!_psReady(1))return;
  const box=$('pset-colors');box.innerHTML='';
  NAME_COLORS.forEach(c=>{
    const d=document.createElement('div');
    d.className='sw'+(c==='theme'?' theme-sw':'')+((_ps.nameColor||'theme')===c?' on':'');
    if(c==='theme')d.textContent='默认';else d.style.background=c;
    d.addEventListener('click',()=>{_ps.nameColor=c;drawSwatches()});
    box.appendChild(d);
  });
}
function drawBgPreview(){
  if(!_psReady(1))return;
  const pv=$('pset-bg-preview');
  const eff=_ps.bgImage||_ps.fbBg;
  if(eff){$('pset-bg-img').src=eff;pv.style.display='';$('pset-bg-clear').style.display=_ps.bgImage?'':'none'}
  else{pv.style.display='none';$('pset-bg-clear').style.display='none'}
}
function drawGal(){
  if(!_psReady(1))return;
  const box=$('pset-gal');box.innerHTML='';
  _ps.gallery.forEach((u,i)=>{
    const eff=u||_ps.fbGallery[i];
    const d=document.createElement('div');d.className='gal-slot'+(eff?' filled':'');
    if(eff)d.style.backgroundImage='url("'+eff+'")';else d.textContent='＋';
    d.addEventListener('click',()=>{_imgTarget='pf-gal-'+i;$('img-file').click()});
    if(u){const x=document.createElement('div');x.className='gal-x';x.textContent='✕';
      x.addEventListener('click',e=>{e.stopPropagation();_ps.gallery[i]='';drawGal()});
      d.appendChild(x)}
    box.appendChild(d);
  });
}
